Short:        L'Abbaye Des Morts
Author:       Locomalito, Amiga port by jeegfro@gmail.com
Uploader:     jeegfro gmail com
Type:         game/actio
Version:      1.1
Requires:     All Amiga with 1MB of memory
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 1.3.0
URL:          http://www.locomalito.com/abbaye_des_morts.php

DESCRIPTION
A platform game adapted from the original Locomalito version.
23 screens to explore.
Riddles and hints to find items.
Around 30 minutes of game length (once fully mastered).

LICENSE
GNU General Public License (GNU GPL)

AMIGA PORT
Coding by Jeegfro.
Music by Simone "JMD" Bernacchia loosely based on Saul Cross C64 soundtrack.
Tests by Amigars

