PLAYING
Use the joystick in port 2

KEYS FROM MENU ONLY
'i' informations
's' switch sfx only / sfx + music
'Esc' quit the game

CHANGES SINCE VERSION 1.0
- Add new sounds effects
- Minor bugs fixes
